{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35738","headline":"读修睦上人歌篇 · 李咸用","name":"读修睦上人歌篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"李白亡，李贺死。\n陈陶赵睦寻相次，须知代不乏骚人。\n贯休之後，惟修睦而已矣。\n睦公睦公真可畏，开口向人无所忌。\n才似烟霞生则媚，直如屈轶佞则指。\n意下纷纷造化机，笔头滴滴文章髓。\n明月清风三十年，被君驱使如奴婢。\n劝君休，莫容易，世俗由来稀则贵。\n珊瑚高架五云毫，小小不须烦藻思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}